{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16077","headline":"赏牡丹 · 王建","name":"赏牡丹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此花名价别，开艳益皇都。\n香遍苓菱死，红烧踯躅枯。\n软光笼细脉，妖色暖鲜肤。\n满蘂攒黄粉，含棱缕绦苏。\n好和薰御服，堪画入宫图。\n晚态愁新妇，残粧望病夫。\n教人知个数，留客赏斯须。\n一夜轻风起，千金买亦无。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16077.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16077","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}